type: software
title: "cosys: packages and Lean 4 proofs for Collaboration Is Composition"
abstract: >-
  The packages that implement a model of collaboration in which every party acts
  through a Mealy machine over an append-only log of signed records, and the Lean 4
  proofs of the paper Collaboration Is Composition: Mealy Machines over Signed
  Records in Poly and Org.
